    </div>

</section>

<!-- FOOTER -->
<footer>

    <h2 style="color:#ffb6c9;">Made With Love ❤️</h2>

    <p>Thank you for being part of my beautiful world.</p>

    <p>Happy Birthday, once again, my love! 💗</p>

    <div style="margin-top:15px;">

